## Step 1 — Block + item + recipe (`lib/world/blocks.ts`, `lib/game/items.ts`, `lib/game/recipes.ts`, `lib/world/atlas.ts`, `lib/game/audio/materials.ts`)

**`lib/world/blocks.ts`**
